      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.direction.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "clearSprites"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.direction.mimi.opening",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w23.asset.sprite.mimi.smile",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "新しい闘技場の骨組みが、空に立った。膝の上には、祝いの帳面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "上棟の朝、削りたての木の香りが、街角まで届く。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "——今日、この祝いに、名前を付ける。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "今日の用は、上棟の祭りと、帳面の白紙を埋めること、勝つ気の支度だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "裁きの日は、もう目と鼻の先にある。その前に、祝いの形だけは決めておきたい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "棟木が上がると、大工さんたちが屋根から、木くずをざあっと払い落とした。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「こけら払いだよ」と、棟梁さん。「屋根のこけらを払って、はじめて建物は仕上がる」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「最初の興行を、柿落としって言うのさ」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.003d",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.003d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……その一言が、帳面の白紙に、音を立てて落ちた。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "決まった。祝いの名前は——柿落とし。四百年目の、新しい闘技場の、最初の興行だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.004b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.004b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帳面に書き込むと、覗いていた仲間から声が飛んだ。「演目は?」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.004c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.004c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「誰が出るんです?」全員です。一人一幕、十五幕。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.direction.mimi.shift.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w23.asset.sprite.mimi.tsukkomi",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "言った先から、帳面は奪い合いになった。「あたし、歌います」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「俺は型の披露」「私は、お客と腕相撲」演目帳は夕方までに、十五幕、埋まった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.005c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.005c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "大取りだけが、空白のまま残る。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.005d",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.005d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ミミさんは?」「私は——当日までに、考えます」",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "日暮れに、花火師さんが一発だけ上げてくれた。あの、長い耳の新作だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「注文主、聞いてないかい?あんたのとこの全員だよ。去年の秋から、こつこつ積み立ててさ」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "……そうでしたか。道理で、まっすぐこちらへ跳ねたわけだ。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "屋根から払われた木屑は、街のみんなで掃き集めた。掃きながら、分かってくる。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "柿落としとは、建てた人たちの手を、最後にもう一度みんなで動かす儀式なのだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.007c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.007c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "祝いは、始まる前から、もう始まっている。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "帰りぎわ、旧会場の壁に、新しい貼り紙が出た。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.008b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.008b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「四百年目の審理——旧会場、最後の興行として執り行う」裁きが、興行になった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.008c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.008c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この街らしいと言えば、これほどらしいこともない。",
      "emotion": "comic"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.direction.mimi.shift.002",
      "command": {
        "type": "show",
        "assetId": "main.s3.w23.asset.sprite.mimi.serious",
        "actorId": "mimi",
        "slot": "left",
        "scale": "tall"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "板には、もう枠が立っている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「ミミさんの言い分、いよいよ本審。通るか通らぬか」倍率は、見なかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "main.s3.w23.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "見なくても——客席が満員になることだけは、分かっている。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "effect",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.effect.001",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "sharedPoints",
          "amount": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "end",
      "id": "main.s3.w23.node.end.001",
      "mode": "return-to-week"
    }
  ],
  "debug": {
